<title>USA: CBOE says membership sells for record $675,000.</title>
<headline>CBOE says membership sells for record $675,000.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said Friday an exchange membership sold for a record $675,000.</p>
<p>The previous record was $650,000 set April 30.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
